  "title": "· New Bags | Miu Miu Drops the Rendez-vous Bag from Fall 2026 ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Miu Miu 上架2026秋冬秀款新包：Rendez-vous 手袋",
  "excerpt": "Miu Miu's Fall/Winter 2026 \"Mindful Intimacy\" collection blends retro softness with edge, featuring the distressed leather Rendez-vous bag inspired by a 2011 archive.",
