    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu has just unveiled its Fall/Winter 2026 collection, themed \"Mindful Intimacy.\" The designer blends retro silhouettes, soft fabrics, and hard-edged details to convey a sense of feminine gentleness and strength. The new Rendez-vous bag, inspired by a 2011 archival style, reinterprets a vintage saddle silhouette in distressed nappa leather, exuding a carefree and rebellious spirit.",
