    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Drawing from a 2011 archive design, the Rendez-vous bag features a soft, vegetable-tanned nappa leather that shapes a vintage saddle silhouette. It is adorned with woven leather handles, a crescent-shaped flap, a buckle strap, an embossed logo, antique-finished hardware, and a detachable leather name tag, striking a balance between nonchalance and defiance.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4l3n1qt/c79f893307232318.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4l3n1qt/c6f9c0dc357b829d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The distressed vegetable-tanned lambskin lends the bag a vintage patina, while the interior is lined with supple suede. A back zip pocket can be unbuttoned for removal, and the gathered top opening keeps contents secure while adding an elegant touch. The large size comes in four colors—black, oak, heather, and aubergine—deep earthy tones perfect for autumn. With a top handle and detachable shoulder strap, it can be carried by hand, on the shoulder, or crossbody.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
