    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The small Rendez-vous bag is offered in oak, aubergine, heather, and chalk white, with a compact silhouette that exudes a playful preppy vibe. The vegetable-tanned leather will develop a unique patina over time, giving each bag its own character. The low-saturation hues feel restrained and sophisticated.",
